  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Seaweed salad brings fresh coastal flavor to your table with tender strands of wakame tossed in a light, tangy dressing. Rice vinegar and gluten free tamari create a savory base, while a touch of sesame oil and gentle sweetness balance every bite. Crisp cucumber and a sprinkle of sesame seeds add texture, making this chilled salad refreshing, vibrant, and perfect as a quick healthy side for noodles, rice bowls, or grilled vegetables.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-seaweed-salad\">Why You’ll Love This seaweed salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-seaweed-salad\">How to Make Seaweed Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-seaweed-salad\">Pro Tips for Making seaweed salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-seaweed-salad\">How to Serve this seaweed salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-seaweed-salad\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This seaweed salad</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s packed with nutrients that boost your health.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, perfect for busy days.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Deliciously unique flavor that elevates any meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Low in calories, making it a guilt-free side dish.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile and can be customized to your taste.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-12906\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"12906\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div